<title>USA: Fiserv, BHC Financial in merger pact.</title>
<headline>Fiserv, BHC Financial in merger pact.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKFIELD, Wis. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiserv Inc said Monday it agreed to acquire BHC Financial Inc's  outstanding shares for $33.50 per share, subject to receiving pooling accounting treatment.</p>
<p>The company said it would determine the exchange ratio by taking the average of the closing price of Fiserv common stock for the last 20 trading days ending two days prior to closing.</p>
</text>
